<title>USA: TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 6-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Night match</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) v 3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
</text>
